OL,3,GNEWSABody found in search for missing  
OL,4,A20-year-old woman                      
OL,6,FA body has been found in the search for
OL,7,Fa missing 20-year-old woman in Dumfries
OL,8,Fand Galloway.                          
OL,10,FFormal identification has not yet taken
OL,11,Fplace but the family of Kelsey Hunter  
OL,12,Fhas been informed.                     
OL,14,FShe was last seen in Castle Douglas at 
OL,15,F17:00 on Saturday and a major search   
OL,16,Fhas been taking place in the nearby    
OL,17,Fvillage of Springholm where she lived. 
