OL,3,GNEWSABody found in search for missing  
OL,4,A20-year-old woman                      
OL,6,FDaniel McKnight, 21, appeared on       
OL,7,FTuesday on petition in Dumfries Sheriff
OL,8,FCourt charged with murder and two other
OL,9,Fcharges, including defeating the ends  
OL,10,Fof justice. He made no plea and was    
OL,11,Fremanded in custody.                   
